msgstr "link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/31235[Hibernate ORM 6] (sin Hibernate Reactive)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "@Inject for https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/31392[Hibernate StatelessSession]"
