#, fuzzy
msgid "<code>quarkus deploy</code> in all dev tools"
msgstr "<code>quarkus deploy</code> en todas las herramientas de desarrollo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus CLI and the Maven and Gradle plugins now have the ability to `deploy`."
msgstr "Quarkus CLI y los plugins de Maven y Gradle ahora tienen la capacidad de `deploy`."

#, fuzzy
msgid "This enables the deployment of Quarkus applications to platforms like Kubernetes, Knative and OpenShift. All without requiring changes to the project dependencies or configuration and therefore simplifying developer experience."
